+// Probes GPU device creation without a window (a scratch device, created
+// and destroyed here): Select() falls back to gl before the window is
+// created when the device cannot be created, instead of leaving a black
+// window. The real backend creates its own device in Init.
+bool GpuDeviceAvailable() {
+  SIM::Gpu::Device probe;
+  return probe.Create();
+}
